---
import AppPageShell from '../components/AppPageShell.astro';
---
<AppPageShell
  title="Terms of Service and Booking Conditions | Pickupr"
  description="Review Pickupr service terms, booking rules, cancellations, waiting time policy, and passenger responsibilities."
  canonical="/terms-of-service"
  structuredData={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'WebPage',
    name: 'Terms of Service',
    url: 'https://pickupr.com/terms-of-service',
    inLanguage: 'en',
  }}
/>

<main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-12 text-zinc-900">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-zinc-700">
    These terms apply to all transfers and chauffeur services booked via Pickupr channels.
  </p>

  <section class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-zinc-700">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Bookings and Fares</h2>
    <p>Quotes are based on booking details and include the listed service conditions and inclusions.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Cancellations</h2>
    <p>Free cancellation is available up to 24 hours before scheduled pickup unless a different condition is stated at booking.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Waiting Time</h2>
    <p>Airport pickups include a free waiting window as stated at booking confirmation.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900">Passenger Conduct</h2>
    <p>Passengers must follow applicable laws and safety instructions during the journey.</p>
  </section>
</main>
